 a world. From skittish sea urchins, and friendly anemones, to a scary wrasse, and a curious octopus. Make hasty retreats and temporary alliances. Interact with a thriving, rambling community under the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/6103b3c598653538c1385b0279815518.poster.avif?t=1772989042\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/6103b3c598653538c1385b0279815518.webm?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/6103b3c598653538c1385b0279815518.mp4?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/807cb2e30f3c432b099f95f7e4128519.avif?t=1772989042\" alt=\"Hardcore Parkour\" width=620 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Climb over ancient furniture and ride on bubble currents to reach high places. Squeeze through gaps in the walls between rooms to access new worlds. Acquire awesome skills and learn how to do all the funny things that crustaceans do to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/1f7f8e65dd8248dab2552bb975ca0103.poster.avif?t=1772989042\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/1f7f8e65dd8248dab2552bb975ca0103.webm?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/1f7f8e65dd8248dab2552bb975ca0103.mp4?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/dfb24f99447d7a0767fd124f216fe8e7.avif?t=1772989042\" alt=\"Shell Care &amp; Repair\" width=620 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">In your quest to find a real seashell, you\u2019ll find all kinds of halfway homes that mostly suck. But you can enjoy customising and repairing them, which can have a <strong>BIG</strong> effect on how you\u2019re seen by others. Do you want to be seen as toxic or a tasty treat?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/0de38c0903be86c93b546de914aa26c4.poster.avif?t=1772989042\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/0de38c0903be86c93b546de914aa26c4.webm?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470880/extras/0de38c0903be86c93b546de914aa26c4.mp4?t=1772989042\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></sp